       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    DOBCHQ0A.
       AUTHOR.        HELENE DESCHENES.
       INSTALLATION.  BANQUE NATIONALE DU CANADA.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  AOUT 1994.
       DATE-COMPILED.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-370.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS000-CONSTANTES.
           05  WS000-PROGRAMME-X          PIC X(008)  VALUE 'DOBCHQ0A'.
           05  WS000-CBLTBNC2-X           PIC X(008)  VALUE 'CBLTBNC2'.
           05  WS000-DOMSB000-X           PIC X(008)  VALUE 'DOMSB000'.
           05  WS000-DOMCT520-X           PIC X(008)  VALUE 'DOMCT520'.
           05  WS000-DOMADCO0-X           PIC X(008)  VALUE 'DOMADCO0'.

       01  WS010-VARIABLES.
           05  WS010-MODULE-APPELE        PIC X(008).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

       10000-TRAITEMENT-INITIAL.
           CALL 'DOMCE010' USING  BY  REFERENCE  B1GENE-ZONE-CONTROLE.
           IF  NOT (B1AP01-88-CODE-POURSUIVRE)
               PERFORM 90000-TERMINER-ANORMALEMENT THRU 90000-EXIT
           END-IF.

           CALL 'DOMSA000' USING  CTL-ENRG-OPERATION
                                  B1AP01-CONTROLE-ENRG-RENV.

       10000-EXIT. EXIT.

       12000-INITIALISATION-GENERALE.
           MOVE  WS000-S00001-X  TO  MAGEWI-FONCTION.
           PERFORM 50000-ACCES-BASE-DONNEES THRU 50000-EXIT.

           CALL 'DOMCE020' USING  BY  REFERENCE  B1GENE-ZONE-CONTROLE.
           IF  NOT (B1AP01-88-CODE-POURSUIVRE)
               PERFORM 90000-TERMINER-ANORMALEMENT THRU 90000-EXIT
           END-IF.

       12000-EXIT. EXIT.

       24210-FORMATTER-TRX-CO.
           CALL 'DOMCT010' USING
                           BY REFERENCE B1GENE-ZONE-CONTROLE
                           BY CONTENT   MCT01I-REQUETE-OPERATION
                           BY REFERENCE MCT01O-RESULTAT-VALIDER.

           PERFORM 80000-VERIFIER-CODE-GLOBAL THRU 80000-EXIT.

       24210-EXIT. EXIT.

       24221-VALIDER-OPER-ACCEPTEE.
           CALL 'DOMCT020' USING
                           BY REFERENCE B1GENE-ZONE-CONTROLE
                           BY CONTENT   MCT02I-CREER-OPERATION
                           BY REFERENCE MCT02O-RESULTAT-CREER.

           PERFORM 80000-VERIFIER-CODE-GLOBAL THRU 80000-EXIT.

       24221-EXIT. EXIT.

       29998-ACCES-DOMCT540.
           CALL 'DOMCT540' USING BY
                           REFERENCE B1GENE-ZONE-CONTROLE
                           CONTENT   MCT54I-CARACTERISTIQUE
                           REFERENCE MCT54O-RESULTAT.

           PERFORM 80000-VERIFIER-CODE-GLOBAL THRU 80000-EXIT.

       29998-EXIT. EXIT.

       80000-VERIFIER-CODE-GLOBAL.
           CONTINUE.
       80000-EXIT. EXIT.

       90000-TERMINER-ANORMALEMENT.
           STOP RUN.
       90000-EXIT. EXIT.

       END PROGRAM DOBCHQ0A.
